  "review": [
    {
      "section": "time.clock",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "\"0\": bare hour (\"jedna\", \"dvě\"), :05-:30 colloquial digital reading (\"dvě nula pět\", \"dvě patnáct\", \"dvě třicet\"), :35-:55 \"za X minut {next_h}\" (\"za pět minut tři\", nominative is correct). Used \"za patnáct minut {next_h}\" at :45 rather than the audit's \"za čtvrt {next_h}\", which I don't believe is standard. Idiomatic \"čtvrt na tři\", \"půl třetí\", \"tři čtvrtě na tři\" need accusative and feminine-ordinal next-hour lists (schema follow-up)."
    }
